            <ArticleTitle>Treatment of a coronary aneurysm involving bifurcation with the use of a custom-made polytetrafluoroethylene-covered bifurcation stent system.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>169-72</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>We report a case with a large aneurysm of the proximal left anterior descending coronary artery involving the bifurcation with a diagonal branch. We used a custom-made bifurcation system with a polytetrafluoroethylene-covered stent for the main branch and a bare metal stent for the side branch with excellent clinical and angiographic result at 5-month follow-up.</AbstractText>
                <CopyrightInformation>2005 Wiley-Liss, Inc.</CopyrightInformation>
            </Abstract>
